#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:10002
#: f1ca426f6da44505bf2e3d350df2b758
msgid "Finesse 3 Interoperability: Simulation vs. Measurement"
msgstr "Finesse 3 連携: シミュレーションと測定の統合"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:10004
#: a7cfafa3e3c644859a7bb3e58a6d3ef0
msgid ""
"[Finesse 3](https://finesse.ifosim.org/) is an interferometer simulation "
"toolkit used at gravitational-wave detector sites to model optical transfer "
"functions and noise budgets.  gwexpy provides a direct bridge from Finesse 3"
" solutions to its own `FrequencySeries` types."
msgstr ""
"[Finesse 3](https://finesse.ifosim.org/)は、重力波検出器サイトで干渉計の光学 "
"伝達関数やノイズバジェットをモデル化するシミュレーションツールです。 gwexpy は Finesse 3 のソリューションオブジェクトを "
"`FrequencySeries` に 直接変換するブリッジを提供します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:10009
#: 54689c37032e4653a32dbc6d1a950c8b
msgid "**What this tutorial covers:**"
msgstr "**このチュートリアルで学ぶこと：**"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:10010
#: e3f155245a4344c1ba5355321caa6e92
msgid "Setting up a Finesse 3 interferometer model (Fabry-Pérot cavity)"
msgstr "Finesse 3 で Fabry-Pérot キャビティモデルを構築する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:10011
#: 744e597a5cf14451a182134bc7fa78b4
msgid "Running a frequency response analysis and converting to gwexpy"
msgstr "周波数応答解析を実行し gwexpy に変換する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:10012
#: 7fc463fc583a426ab446cfe2c672ed96
msgid "Running a noise projection and converting to gwexpy"
msgstr "ノイズプロジェクションを実行し gwexpy に変換する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:10013
#: 0895766d62694510a3da1941ae2ec3d4
msgid "Overlaying simulation and measurement for comparison"
msgstr "シミュレーションと測定データをオーバーレイ比較する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:10015
#: 737c38bc780f4d349da8755bec0b7b4d
msgid ""
"**Note**: This notebook is self-contained. When Finesse 3 is not installed "
"it synthesises equivalent data analytically so every cell still executes. "
"Install Finesse 3 with `pip install finesse` to run the real simulation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:20002
#: 592b5c6353f44be380975ad7a7fef0ce
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "準備"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:40002
#: 79e068bf1f574961a959203c5abaf826
msgid "1. Finesse 3 Model — Fabry-Pérot Cavity"
msgstr "1. Finesse 3 モデル — Fabry-Pérot キャビティ"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:40004
#: b06d443253ff4b6cab63da12004132b5
msgid ""
"The cell below builds a single Fabry-Pérot cavity (mirror + beam splitter) "
"and computes the intracavity power transfer function from the input mirror "
"drive to the cavity transmission."
msgstr ""
"以下のセルで、単純な Fabry-Pérot キャビティ（ミラー + ビームスプリッター）を "
"構築し、入力ミラードライブからキャビティ透過光への伝達関数を計算します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:40008
#: 0b51ae0ea11f4bfd926b720fb01c1457
msgid ""
"If Finesse 3 is **not** installed the cell falls back to analytic formulas "
"for an equivalent optical cavity and wraps the result in `FrequencySeries` "
"directly — the gwexpy objects produced by both paths are identical."
msgstr ""
"Finesse 3 がインストールされていない場合は、等価な光学キャビティの解析式に フォールバックします。どちらのパスも同一の gwexpy "
"オブジェクトを生成します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:60002
#: 75e178d0a175450897efbb1c4f86f528
msgid "2. Multi-DOF Transfer Function Matrix"
msgstr "2. 多自由度（マルチ DOF）伝達関数マトリクス"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:60004
#: e2892acded954c919b8d74b28a6e6700
msgid ""
"Real interferometers have multiple degrees of freedom (DARM, CARM, MICH, …)."
" `from_finesse_frequency_response` returns a **FrequencySeriesMatrix** when "
"multiple output / input DOF pairs are present."
msgstr ""
"実際の干渉計には複数の自由度（DARM、CARM、MICH 等）があります。 複数の出力/入力 DOF "
"ペアがある場合、`from_finesse_frequency_response` は 自動的に **FrequencySeriesDict** "
"を返します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:80002
#: 4d9747d2b05e4809bc49589519fcd885
msgid "3. Noise Projection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_finesse_optics.ipynb:80004
#: 7a1c2f4a687d41dbb4384b57a9c146cc
msgid ""
"`from_finesse_noise` converts a Finesse 3 `NoiseProjectionSolution` to a "
"`FrequencySeriesDict` keyed by `\"<output_node>: <noise_source>\"`."
msgstr ""

